{"content":[{"c":["SUR GATE"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Gate in Jerusalem linking the king’s palace to the temple. It is mentioned in ",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.11.6","r":"2Kgs.11.6","rawR":"2Kgs.11.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.11.6","value":"2Kgs.11.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kings 11:6"}," in connection with the enthronement of Jehoash over Judah and the murder of Athaliah. Its parallel passage in ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.23.5","r":"2Chr.23.5","rawR":"2Chr.23.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.23.5","value":"2Chr.23.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chronicles 23:5"}," reads the “Gate of the Foundation,” revealing perhaps a corruption within the Hebrew text."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"SurGate","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Kings 11:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.11.6","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.11.6","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.11.6"},{"anchorText":"2 Chronicles 23:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.23.5","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.23.5","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.23.5"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"ff3590be187b9995e591a98cee82ccc9a492809355e49a0441b763f664e87a76","sourceItemName":"SurGate","sourceItemOrder":583,"sourceMember":"Articles/S.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"SurGate","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Sur Gate","title":"Sur Gate","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}